{"schema_version":1,"batch_id":"screening-0086","screening_model":"gpt-5.6-luna","reasoning":"medium","prompt_version":"gauss-screening-v1","item_count":9,"subject":"math","topic_key":"probability","total_weight":120,"expected_output":"screening-0086.output.jsonl","items":[{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1863","source_sha256":"e3e9491aa53324539e9a693f3ad6fafaf790853b87b17e69abf25590437baa4e","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"در یک جعبه ۵ مهرهٔ زرد، ۳ مهرهٔ آبی و ۲ مهرهٔ قرمز وجود دارد. سه مهره از جعبه خارج می‌کنیم، احتمال آن که رنگ هر سه مهره متمایز باشد چند برابر آن است که مهره‌ها از یک رنگ باشند؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1863/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال ۱۸۶۳","aspect_ratio":0.0902}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"۳"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1863/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":1.5745}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{5}{2}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1863/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":1.6087}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{30}{11}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1863/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":1.3962}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{15}{4}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1863/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":1.1385}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"پیشامد آن‌که رنگ هر سه مهره متمایز باشد را $A$ و پیشامد آن‌که هر سه مهره هم‌رنگ باشند را $B$ می‌نامیم.\n$P(A) = \\frac{\\binom{5}{1}\\binom{3}{1}\\binom{2}{1}}{\\binom{10}{3}} = \\frac{30}{120}$\n$P(B) = \\frac{\\binom{5}{3} + \\binom{3}{3}}{\\binom{10}{3}} = \\frac{11}{120}$\n$\\Rightarrow \\frac{P(A)}{P(B)} = \\frac{30}{11}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1863/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1863/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1863/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1863/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1863/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1863/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"2dd1498fedc62cabb418912a21dbc88c58674463c0d3e7e2245b481dde72cc45","bytes":516},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1863/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"b03b7ba6d8c340e10e7ac37af165281ebec234db3e299053d7482dc92281608b","bytes":516},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1863/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"7f79dc63ead0eca2d5dea7741d2c6c96a3b0f57466c044a806f69717cac4e32f","bytes":632},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1863/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"0479c18500e106cddf55d6afb467284b3ed5998cbc241a383bd3f121a13d5dfa","bytes":648},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1863/stem_1.webp","sha256":"dbfb31dcf886f4e0d7ebcc48e139468aaff6d0c54b840e63d14c70eac0a08b22","bytes":8796}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1863,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":12,"solution_page":172,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1864","source_sha256":"d65682f66ec3db18e4bd6fa6cd441bb6d0e815a10ab7cc9124977322776daf64","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"از ۵ جفت کفش متمایز، ۴ لنگه کفش انتخاب می‌کنیم. با کدام احتمال دقیقاً یک جفت کفش در بین آن‌هاست؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1864/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال ۱۸۶۴","aspect_ratio":0.0549}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{3}{7}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1864/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":1.5745}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{4}{7}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1864/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":1.6087}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{4}{9}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1864/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":1.3962}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{5}{9}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1864/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":1.1385}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"پیشامد مورد نظر را $A$ می‌نامیم.\nروش اول: ابتدا یک جفت کفش از بین ۵ جفت انتخاب می‌کنیم. حال از ۸ لنگه کفش باقی‌مانده ۲ لنگه کفش انتخاب می‌کنیم. برای این‌که این دو از یک جفت نباشند، حالات نامطلوب را کم می‌کنیم.\n$n(A) = \\binom{5}{1} \\left( \\binom{8}{2} - \\binom{4}{1} \\right) = 5 \\times (28 - 4) = 5 \\times 24 = 120$\nروش دوم: ابتدا یک جفت کفش انتخاب می‌کنیم. ۲ لنگه کفش باقی‌مانده باید از ۲ جفت کفش متمایز باشد. بنابراین ۲ جفت کفش از ۴ جفت باقی‌مانده انتخاب کرده، از هر جفت ۱ لنگه انتخاب می‌کنیم.\n$n(A) = \\binom{5}{1}\\binom{4}{2}\\binom{2}{1}\\binom{2}{1} = 5 \\times 6 \\times 2 \\times 2 = 120$\nبنابراین:\n$P(A) = \\frac{n(A)}{n(S)} = \\frac{120}{\\binom{10}{4}} = \\frac{120}{210} = \\frac{4}{7}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1864/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1864/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1864/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1864/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1864/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1864/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"ab268bada54ea2718d5de2f22b725101db4572884d0b8858d2f7224ba9b1eb75","bytes":1154},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1864/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"e304c84fe078c1d9e6f3a73b3cf9ddfa370f833ab315b3e66fa2c4249dbfe4f3","bytes":900},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1864/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"7d1921b8129fffeed40e5501dfc9f152d2bb0ccb92819593dbb906551e255594","bytes":1084},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1864/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"8db99382e2e16ceac1a888e77f48abc2d36c96fbc1eaafe05f4d236ecf4e547f","bytes":1020},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1864/stem_1.webp","sha256":"5bad51736766dd1a0c11927cdcdfd9774562a93f271cef649e8807bb06c80b9d","bytes":9908}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1864,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":12,"solution_page":172,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1865","source_sha256":"dedcb3312f9c4cadacd63197d460b590bbf8d54cc38cd57970f64fc6834f0897","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"در پرتاب ۴ سکه احتمال ظاهر شدن حداکثر یک «رو» کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1865/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال ۱۸۶۵","aspect_ratio":0.0549}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{1}{4}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1865/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":1.5745}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{1}{16}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1865/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":1.6087}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{5}{16}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1865/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":1.3962}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{3}{8}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1865/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":1.1385}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"احتمال آن را می‌یابیم که یا یک «رو» بیاید و یا صفر «رو».\n$P(A) = \\frac{\\overbrace{\\binom{5}{1}\\binom{4}{3}}^{\\text{۱ رو \\ ۳ پشت}} + \\overbrace{\\binom{5}{0}\\binom{4}{4}}^{\\text{صفر رو \\ ۴ پشت}}}{2^4} = \\frac{4 + 1}{16} = \\frac{5}{16}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1865/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1865/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1865/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1865/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1865/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1865/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"672672d9d9171c636438cc27278367d18365f9ba860ad34a0b7ab7c3b8b82711","bytes":1066},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1865/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"2ebaf10f69293f715003b4ec3f39c28b722dc7a3b467d26a9b70ae1378d27bc9","bytes":986},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1865/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"c0fae61f2906f297d5affac726f5330abb243e115726cae74bc183c983019e09","bytes":1230},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1865/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"c3aaff16981f3d1cc3826aa0294538213add14de648041004f1e3b79fd6bde90","bytes":1308},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1865/stem_1.webp","sha256":"8409535ce692ae703b3520229422150d407f29610d22293fad4ac4bc31bd7e00","bytes":8796}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1865,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":12,"solution_page":172,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1866","source_sha256":"46b67fabcbc4054bb19d88b063b9f48cbacfdbb120dfd8e1deaca1e95b50cc5d","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"۳ توپ متمایز را به تصادف در ۴ سبد با ظرفیت بیش از ۱ توپ قرار می‌دهیم. با چه احتمالی در سبد اول حداقل یک توپ قرار می‌گیرد؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1866/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال ۱۸۶۶","aspect_ratio":0.0549}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{27}{64}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1866/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":1.5745}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{7}{16}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1866/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":1.6087}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{9}{16}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1866/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":1.3962}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{37}{64}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1866/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":1.1385}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"روش اول: در فضای نمونه‌ای هر توپ ۴ حالت دارد.\nاگر در سبد اول یک توپ قرار گیرد، هر یک از ۲ توپ باقی‌مانده به ۳ حالت در ۳ سبد باقی‌مانده قرار می‌گیرند. اگر در سبد اول دو توپ قرار گیرد، ۱ توپ باقی‌مانده به ۳ حالت در ۳ سبد باقی‌مانده قرار می‌گیرد. در یک حالت نیز هر سه توپ در سبد اول قرار دارد.\n$P(A) = \\frac{\\binom{3}{1} \\times 3^2 + \\binom{3}{2} \\times 3 + \\binom{3}{3}}{4^3} = \\frac{27 + 9 + 1}{64} = \\frac{37}{64}$\nروش دوم: روش متمم:\n$P(A) = 1 - P(\\text{در سبد اول توپی قرار نگیرد}) = 1 - \\frac{3^3}{4^3} = 1 - \\frac{27}{64} = \\frac{37}{64}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1866/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1866/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1866/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1866/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1866/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1866/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"84d605a55a1b0f32bfcc81b7741a43c0c0f96a8a235f0c43f1b750130a72eb62","bytes":570},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1866/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"54d2c9428aeff44a28a859c2ac27fce8c345702bc07f81dc596ef79a07bda476","bytes":668},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1866/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"dc5c8bea5227ccbebb541d70b936e4067f1ddb9475c14fcb831f2afab30bddb5","bytes":752},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1866/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"50c31f4de8f6ac16f9f2c5a3ebaadb0aca5975f3c9d5ec48a63fab8131564541","bytes":920},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1866/stem_1.webp","sha256":"fc838ab1b3094788f86dfd289dd4bad238f2313b11192c2a380eee8c55b46838","bytes":4168}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1866,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":12,"solution_page":172,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1867","source_sha256":"b420392645e9eff9a9993dc92b58933a4caf0424c0b2645d007c8738ebf923ce","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"$A$ و $B$ دو پیشامد در یک فضای نمونه‌ای و $P(A) = 0/7$، $P(B) = 0/8$ و $P(B \\cap A') = 0/2$ است. $P(A' \\cap B')$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1867/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال ۱۸۶۷","aspect_ratio":0.0549}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$0/1$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1867/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":1.1915}],[{"type":"text","text":"$0/2$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1867/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":1.2174}],[{"type":"text","text":"$0/3$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1867/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":1.2174}],[{"type":"text","text":"$0/4$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1867/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":0.9492}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ابتدا $P(A \\cap B)$ را به دست می‌آوریم:\n$P(B \\cap A') = P(B - A) = \\underbrace{P(B)}_{0/8} - P(A \\cap B) = 0/2 \\Rightarrow P(A \\cap B) = 0/6$\nخواهیم داشت:\n$P(A' \\cap B') = P((A \\cup B)') = 1 - P(A \\cup B)$\n$= 1 - (P(A) + P(B) - P(A \\cap B)) = 1 - (0/7 + 0/8 - 0/6) = 1 - 0/9 = 0/1$\nمی‌توانستیم بگوییم $P(A \\cup B) = P(A) + P(B \\cap A') = 0/9$ و نیازی به محاسبهٔ $P(A \\cap B)$ نبود."}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1867/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1867/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1867/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1867/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1867/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1867/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"2f14118ffdca33ec41db1ad9c9ef6fc2cea2b421b3e9dde2923dd197bfe88c27","bytes":62},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1867/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"1fef4b3231221dad25144b284f538f45eab290fd1492fc418238597f54022b3a","bytes":164},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1867/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"e7308c089752595fcaa6ebfadf00900b1fd8fb5529ca92c0558b814bbb63d4d9","bytes":212},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1867/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"59162a8d710a10523317a02eac9232fed6a446893284ec7267b1270f968a9c06","bytes":240},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1867/stem_1.webp","sha256":"37170c30a6b9e19dcc84bf5814f4df1a9d596ed20a9411a820dd9d2b1af3c687","bytes":4670}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1867,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":12,"solution_page":172,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1868","source_sha256":"de8ca23f63d1a13f6b7f5e656484b6ce276952b039d611c19a8274be33549425","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"$A$ و $B$ دو پیشامد در فضای $S$ هستند به طوری که $P(A) = 2P(B) = 3P(A \\cap B)$. اگر $P(A \\cup B) = \\frac{7}{12}$، مقدار $P(A' \\cup B)$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1868/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال ۱۸۶۸","aspect_ratio":0.0637}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{1}{3}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1868/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":1.5745}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{1}{2}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1868/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":1.6087}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{2}{3}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1868/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":1.6087}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{3}{4}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1868/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":1.2542}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"می‌دانیم:\n$P(A \\cup B) = P(A) + P(B) - P(A \\cap B)$\nبنابراین:\n$\\frac{7}{12} = 3P(A \\cap B) + \\frac{3}{2} P(A \\cap B) - P(A \\cap B)$\n$\\Rightarrow P(A \\cap B) = \\frac{1}{6} \\Rightarrow P(A) = \\frac{3}{6} = \\frac{1}{2}, \\ P(B) = \\frac{3}{12} = \\frac{1}{4}$\nدر نتیجه:\n$P(A' \\cup B) = P(A') + P(B) - P(A' \\cap B)$\n$= 1 - P(A) + \\underbrace{P(B) - P(B - A)}_{P(A \\cap B)} = 1 - \\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{2}{3}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1868/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1868/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1868/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1868/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1868/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1868/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"b1da621b5a11e119f706aa2197bc6b70df66e557979884d9369c056658bf8996","bytes":64},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1868/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"88e0a79cdd2d517f8b8668e3adcb1a5a78bf16b23237b8d1b101b8e4f2a8c14a","bytes":64},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1868/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"88e0a79cdd2d517f8b8668e3adcb1a5a78bf16b23237b8d1b101b8e4f2a8c14a","bytes":64},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1868/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"d519ccd7b2cff2c296c1b249b4f2ca4d9fc1fc3f76f588acd2fad4c4f839a1e0","bytes":68},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1868/stem_1.webp","sha256":"208a2d6d35a1286c07080c48ef32ea581d9a18292d1ffcc3eef401d1d4ad62a4","bytes":6490}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1868,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":12,"solution_page":172,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1869","source_sha256":"15bbdadc355d57ece03047ba40815a86b04e89d94856f271bc109c9fdaa6e162","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"$A$ و $B$ دو پیشامد از یک فضای نمونه‌ای و $P(A - B) = P(A) - P(B)$ است. حاصل $P(B - A)$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1869/stem_1.webp","alt":"Question 1869 stem","aspect_ratio":0.0686},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1869/options_2.webp","alt":"Question 1869 options","aspect_ratio":0.0546}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$P(B) - P(A)$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$P(B)$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$P(A)$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"صفر"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"می‌دانیم:\n$P(A - B) = P(A) - P(A \\cap B)$\nمی‌باشد و چون $P(A - B) = P(A) - P(B)$ شده است نتیجه می‌گیریم $P(A \\cap B) = P(B)$، یعنی $B \\subseteq A$ است.\nبنابراین: $P(B - A) = P(B) - P(A \\cap B) = P(B) - P(B) = 0$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1869/options_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1869/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1869/options_2.webp","sha256":"1c7510e17cd80ed715e04d03253da7509cd1e22e945ef644587872dff190e191","bytes":2334},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1869/stem_1.webp","sha256":"a4d3610c52064bf885b7eb73f0329dd6ed06f780170414cdf9c5e11ef8ffb7c5","bytes":6382}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1869,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":13,"solution_page":172,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1870","source_sha256":"388dba00d89d8875878cd39706914eaf7bad7f3bfe2b0791405d3a07976ade74","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"$A$ و $B$ دو پیشامد از فضای نمونه‌ای $S$ می‌باشند. اگر $P(A - B) = \\frac{1}{8}$ ، $P(B - A) = \\frac{3}{8}$ و $۲P(A) = P(B)$ باشد، حاصل $P(A)$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1870/stem_1.webp","alt":"Question 1870 stem","aspect_ratio":0.0756},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1870/options_2.webp","alt":"Question 1870 options","aspect_ratio":0.0546}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{1}{8}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{1}{6}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{1}{4}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{1}{3}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"از نمودار ون کمک می‌گیریم:\n$P(B) = 2P(A) \\Rightarrow x + \\frac{3}{8} = 2(x + \\frac{1}{8}) \\Rightarrow x = \\frac{1}{8}$\n$P(A) = x + \\frac{1}{8} = \\frac{1}{8} + \\frac{1}{8} = \\frac{2}{8} = \\frac{1}{4}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1870/solution_text_3.webp","alt":"نمودار ون شامل دو مجموعه A و B","aspect_ratio":0.7212}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1870/options_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1870/solution_text_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1870/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1870/options_2.webp","sha256":"40dbbfbabbb4130efa652ca176ceba5ffd1522fc3d9ab05e55c7e015d424f8e7","bytes":3448},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1870/solution_text_3.webp","sha256":"f5dd347d014910c53db436e4cfb7a7b968fcb3e089cd358b3dcc058da60745d9","bytes":6998},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1870/stem_1.webp","sha256":"2105cd0f822bb05cc362b0cc5e84e1cb6a3a982b33c4118616911d285648dc79","bytes":4306}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1870,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":13,"solution_page":172,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1871","source_sha256":"b1cf0eb0f637ab8e3c9cb38c8cb177ff0eb815ef56f617083ee726fba910d254","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $P(A \\cup B') = \\frac{3}{4}$ ، $P(B \\cup A') = \\frac{3}{4}$ و $۶P(A') = ۷P(B')$ باشد، $P(A \\cup B)$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1871/stem_1.webp","alt":"Question 1871 stem","aspect_ratio":0.0686},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1871/options_2.webp","alt":"Question 1871 options","aspect_ratio":0.0546}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{1}{6}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{1}{3}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{2}{3}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{3}{4}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $k = 6P(A') = 7P(B')$، آن‌گاه $P(A') = \\frac{k}{6}$ و $P(B') = \\frac{k}{7}$. خواهیم داشت:\n$P(A \\cup B') = \\frac{2}{3} \\Rightarrow P(B') + \\overbrace{P(A) - P(A \\cap B')}^{P(A \\cap B)} = \\frac{2}{3}$\n$P(B \\cup A') = \\frac{3}{4} \\Rightarrow P(A') + \\underbrace{P(B) - P(B \\cap A')}_{P(A \\cap B)} = \\frac{3}{4}$\n$\\xrightarrow{(-)} P(A') - P(B') = \\frac{3}{4} - \\frac{2}{3} = \\frac{1}{12}$\n$\\Rightarrow \\frac{k}{6} - \\frac{k}{7} = \\frac{1}{12} \\Rightarrow k = \\frac{7}{2} \\Rightarrow P(B') = \\frac{1}{2}, \\ P(A') = \\frac{7}{12}$\n$P(B') + P(A \\cap B) = \\frac{2}{3} \\Rightarrow P(A \\cap B) = \\frac{2}{3} - \\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{1}{6}$\nبنابراین:\n$P(A \\cup B) = P(A) + P(B) - P(A \\cap B) = \\frac{5}{12} + \\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{5 + 6 - 2}{12} = \\frac{9}{12} = \\frac{3}{4}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1871/options_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1871/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1871/options_2.webp","sha256":"5402f58a4518f1de73d41a2852115e2fff245ed81601f947e28547318779feea","bytes":3444},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1871/stem_1.webp","sha256":"4b2431ab335a7e3db7812ca712347e9fdbc769a6069b17faaf1cc4ed9f5f1031","bytes":4280}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1871,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":13,"solution_page":172,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true}]}
